6: Depends on E1 AND E3.\n- E7: Depends on E5 OR E6.\n\nThe only event whose occurrence is contingent upon the \"AND\" condition of E2 (as per the text) is E8. \n\nWait, let's re-read carefully: \"Event E8 requires parent events (E2, E5) under rule AND\". If E2 does not occur, E8 cannot occur.\n\nNo other event depends on E2 via an AND rule. E4 uses OR, so it stays.\n\nFinal list of events that would no longer occur (excluding E2): [\"E8\"]\n\n{\"answer\": [\"E8\"]}", "parsed": ["E8"], "gold": ["E8"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2962, "tokens_out": 761, "seconds": 7.9269, "seed": 4001, "exposed": true}
