{"story_id": "conf_s003", "qid": "conf_s003_q3", "qtype": "Q3", "arm": "A", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thoughtthought\ub85c-thought\n<channel|>To determine which events (excluding E1) would no longer occur if E1 did not happen, we analyze the dependency rules:\n\n1.  **E2**: Autonomous root event; it occurs regardless of E1.\n2.  **E3**: Requires E1 under rule **AND**. If E1 does not occur, E3 does not occur.\n3.  **E4**: Requires (E2, E3) under rule **AND**. Since E3 is now prevented, E4 does not occur.\n4.  **E5**: Requires (E2, E4) under rule **OR**. Since E2 still occurs, E5 still occurs.\n5.  **E6**: Requires E5 under rule **AND**. Since E5 occurs, E6 still occurs.\n6.  **E7**: Requires (E4, E6) under rule **OR**. Since E6 occurs, E7 still occurs.\n7.  **E8**: Requires (E2, E6) under rule **OR**. Since both E2 and E6 occur, E8 still occurs.\n\nThe events that would no longer occur are E3 and E4.\n\n{\"answer\": [\"E3\", \"E4\"]}", "parsed": ["E3", "E4"], "gold": ["E3", "E4"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 896, "tokens_out": 268, "seconds": 2.9978, "seed": 4003, "exposed": false}
{"story_id": "conf_s003", "qid": "conf_s003_q3", "qtype": "Q3", "arm": "B", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "thought\n<channel|>To determine which events (excluding E1) would no longer occur if E1 did not happen, we evaluate the dependency rules:\n\n1.  **E1**: Not occurring (given).\n2.  **E2**: Root event (always occurs), so it still occurs.\n3.  **E3**: Requires E1 (AND rule). Since E1 does not occur, **E3 does not occur**.\n4.  **E4**: Requires E2 AND E3. Since E3 no longer occurs, **E4 does not occur**.\n5.  **E5**: Requires E2 OR E4. Since E2 still occurs, E5 still occurs.\n6.  **E6**: Requires E5 (AND rule). Since E5 still occurs, E6 still occurs.\n7.  **E7**: Requires E4 OR E6. Since E6 still occurs, E7 still occurs.\n8.  **E8**: Requires E2 OR E6. Since both E2 and E6 still occur, E8 still occurs.\n\nThe events that no longer occur (excluding E1) are E3 and E4.\n\n{\"answer\": [\"E3\", \"E4\"]}", "parsed": ["E3", "E4"], "gold": ["E3", "E4"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 879, "tokens_out": 259, "seconds": 2.7094, "seed": 4003, "exposed": false}
