{"story_id": "conf_s004", "qid": "conf_s004_q1", "qtype": "Q1", "arm": "D", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought<channel|>```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT E2\",\n    \"reason\": \"Text states E2 starts at hour 9; Structured Fact says start_hour=21.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"DEPENDENCY: E1 requires (E3) with rule AND\",\n    \"reason\": \"Text defines E1 as an autonomous root event [DEP_E1]; Structured Fact incorrectly lists it as dependent on E3.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E1\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not present in the source text.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E2\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not present in the source text.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E3\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not present in the source text.\"\n  }\n]\n```", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>The text states Event E1 starts at hour 2 and Event E7 starts at hour 37. Therefore, E1 started earlier.\n\n{\"answer\": \"E1\"}", "parsed": "E1", "gold": "E1", "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2785, "tokens_out": 259, "seconds": 3.2244, "seed": 4004, "exposed": true}
{"story_id": "conf_s004", "qid": "conf_s004_q1", "qtype": "Q1", "arm": "F", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought<channel|>To answer whether Event E1 or Event E7 started earlier, I will use the following extracted facts:\n\n**Relevant Facts:**\n*   **Event E1 (Power Distribution Routing):** Starts at hour 2 ([EV_E1]).\n*   **Event E7 (Thermal Radiator Deployment):** Starts at hour 37 ([EV_E7]).\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  Identify the start time for Event E1 from the \"MISSION TIMELINE AND LOG\" section.\n2.  Identify the start time for Event E7 from the \"MISSION TIMELINE AND LOG\" section.\n3.  Compare the two numerical values (hour 2 vs. hour 37).\n4.  Determine which event has the lower start hour and provide the corresponding Event ID.", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>{\"answer\": \"E1\"}", "parsed": "E1", "gold": "E1", "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2722, "tokens_out": 181, "seconds": 2.1839, "seed": 4004, "exposed": true}
