{"story_id": "conf_s011", "qid": "conf_s011_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To find the total combined duration of E5 and E8, we first identify their durations from the text:\n\n1.  **Event E5 (Power Distribution Routing):** The text states E5 starts at hour 34 with a duration of **4 hours**.\n2.  **Event E8 (Primary Thruster Ignition):** The text states E8 starts at hour 57 with a duration of **2 hours**.\n\nThe question asks for the total combined duration: 4 + 2 = 6.\n\n(Note: Even if we check dependencies, E1 and E2 are root events. E3 requires E1 AND E2. E4 requires E1 OR E3. E5 requires E4. E8 requires E1 OR E5. Since E1 and E2 occur, E3 occurs; since E3 occurs, E4 occurs; since E4 occurs, E5 occurs; since E1/E5 occurs, E8 occurs. All events in the sequence are active.)\n\n{\"answer\": 6}", "parsed": 6, "gold": 6, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1334, "tokens_out": 222, "seconds": 2.8761, "seed": 4011, "exposed": true}
{"story_id": "conf_s011", "qid": "conf_s011_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "D", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "{\n  \"contradictions_and_unsupported_unsupported_facts\": [\n    {\n      \"fact_id\": \"EVENT E2\",\n      \"reason\": \"The text states E2 starts at hour 8, but the structured fact graph lists it as starting at hour 24.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact_id\": \"EVENT E3\",\n      \"reason\": \"The \"text\" section for E3 shows start time 16, while the \"structured facts\" list shows no contradiction here, but check others.\"\n    }\n    // Note: I am preparing notes for at most 250 tokens.\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nWait, I'correction-check:\nE1: Text (4,3) vs Graph (4,3) - OK\nE2: Text (8,5) vs Graph (24,5) - CONTRADICTION\nE3: E3 starts at 16 in text. In graph it is 16. OK.\nE4: Text (26,5) vs Graph (26,5). OK.\nE5: Text (", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To find the total combined duration of E5 and E8, we look at the durations provided in the text (which take precedence over the structured facts if a conflict exists):\n\n1.  **Event E5 (Power Distribution Routing)**: The text states it has a duration of 4 hours [EV_E5].\n2.  **Event E8 (Primary Thruster Ignition)**: The text states it has a duration of 2 hours [EV_E8].\n\nTotal combined duration = 4 + 2 = 6.\n\n{\"answer\": 6}", "parsed": 6, "gold": 6, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2861, "tokens_out": 374, "seconds": 4.9707, "seed": 4011, "exposed": true}
