quires (E2, E4) under rule AND ([DEP_E8]). Since E2 and E4 occur, E8 occurs.\n\nWait, let's re-check the text for E3: `Event E3 requires parent events (E1, E2) under rule OR`. If E1 is gone, E3 still has E2. So E3 occurs.\nLet's re-check E6: `Event E6 requires parent events (E_1) under rule AND`. If E1 does not occur, E6 cannot occur.\n\nThe only event whose occurrence depends on E1 via an AND/OR logic that fails if E1 is absent is E6. \nWait, let's re-read: `Event E6 requires parent events (E1)", "parsed": null, "gold": ["E6"], "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 2815, "tokens_out": 762, "seconds": 8.2405, "seed": 4012, "exposed": true}
