{"story_id": "conf_s018", "qid": "conf_s018_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "message much more than one way to look at it.\nIt's not enough just to text and text.\nIt's ownness \nIt'annotation \nIt's an \nIt's a \nIt's a \nIt's a\nIt's a \nIt's a \nIt'a \nIt's a \nE7: duration 6 hours.\nE8: duration 6 hours.\nTotal = 12.\n\nWait, let me re-read the text to bethoughtful.\nE7 (Inertial Damper Calibration) starts at hour 39 with a duration of 6 hours [EV_E7].\nE8 (Cryogenic Manifold Flush) starts at hour 49 with a duration of 5? No, let's check the text.\nText: \"Event E8 (Cryogenic Manifold Flush) started at hour 49 with a duration of 6 hours [EV_E8].\"\nWait, I need to check if they actually occur.\n\nDependencies for E7: (E1, E3) under rule OR.\nE1 is root (always occurs).\nE3 requires (E1, E2) AND.\nE1 and E2 are roots. So E3 occurs.\nSince E1/E3 occur, E7 (requires E1 or E3) occurs.\n\nDependencies for E8: (E3, E6) under rule OR.\nE4 requires (E1, E3) AND.\nE1 and E3 are occurring. So E4 occurs.\nE6 requires (E2, E4) AND.\nE2 is root. E4 is occurring. So E6 occurs.\nSince E3/E6 occur, E8 (requires E3 or E6) occurs.\n\nDurations:\nE7 duration = 6 hours.\nE8 duration = 6 hours.\nTotal = 12.\n\nLet me double check the text for durations one more time.\nE7: \"Event E7... started at hour 39 with a duration of 6 hours\"\nE8: \"Event E8... started ats hour 49 with a duration of 6 hours\"\n\nTotal = 6 + 6 = 12.\n\nWait, let me check the structured facts for any- oh,", "parsed": null, "gold": 12, "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 1280, "tokens_out": 512, "seconds": 5.0111, "seed": 4018, "exposed": true}
{"story_id": "conf_s018", "qid": "conf_s018_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "D", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|turn ownthought\n<channel|>```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT E3\",\n    \"reason\": \"The text defines E3 as starting at hour 15 with duration 6; the structured facts list it as a 'ROOT event', which contradicts the text stating it requires parent events (E1, E2) under rule AND.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E1\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E2\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  },\n  _note: \"The structured facts also incorrectly list E7/E8 dependencies and include unverified 'Fake' events, but these are primarily-driven by the provided graph structure rather than just contradictions of the text content._\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E3\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  }\n]\n```", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To calculate the total combined duration of E7 and E8, we look at the text provided:\n- Event E7 (Inertial Damper Calibration) has a duration of 6 hours.\n- Event E8 (Cryogenic Manifold Flush) has a duration of 6 hours.\n\nThe sum is 6 + 6 = 12.\n\n{\"answer\": 12}", "parsed": 12, "gold": 12, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2744, "tokens_out": 330, "seconds": 3.7402, "seed": 4018, "exposed": true}
