nnot occur without E3, E8 also fails to occur.\n\nWait, let's re-verify the chain:\n- E1 (Root) -> Occurs.\n- E2 (Root) -> Occurs.\n- E3 (Given as not occurring).\n- E4 (Requires E1 AND E3) -> Does NOT occur.\n- E5 (Requires E1) -> Occurs.\n- E6 (Requires E2 AND E4) -> Does NOT occur (because E4 is gone).\n- E7 (Requires E1 OR E3) -> Occurs (E1 occurs).\n- E8 (Requires E3 OR E6) -> Does NOT occur (E3 is not occurring, and E6 is not occurring).\n\nThe events that would no longer occur are E4, E6, and E8.\n\nSorting", "parsed": null, "gold": ["E4", "E6", "E8"], "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 2864, "tokens_out": 742, "seconds": 7.643, "seed": 4018, "exposed": true}
