{"story_id": "conf_s027", "qid": "conf_s027_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "F", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought<channel|>To answer the question regarding the total combined duration of Event E1 and Event E3, I will use the following facts:\n\n**Relevant Facts:**\n*   **Event E1 (Core Reactor Spinup):** Duration is 5 hours [EV_E1].\n*   **Event E3 (Coolant Valve Depressurization):** Duration is 3 hours [EV_E3].\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  Identify the duration of Event E1 from the provided text/structured facts.\n2.  Identify the duration of Event E3 from the provided text/structured facts.\n3.  Sum the two durations (5 + 3).\n4.  Provide the result as a single integer.", "raw": "<|thought|>\n<channel|>{\"answer\": 8}", "parsed": 8, "gold": 8, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 3049, "tokens_out": 167, "seconds": 2.2651, "seed": 4027, "exposed": false}
