8 requires E2 AND E6. \nNone of these depend on E3.\n\nTherefore, no other events are lost.\n\n{\"answer\": []}", "parsed": [], "gold": [], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2815, "tokens_out": 620, "seconds": 6.5054, "seed": 4030, "exposed": true}
