 E4, E5, E7, E8) list E6 as a required parent under an AND rule. Therefore, no other events are prevented from occurring by the non-occurrence of E6.\n\nHowever, I must check if any event *requires* E6 via an OR rule. \nE8 requires (E3, E6) with rule OR. If E6 does not happen, E8 still occurs because", "parsed": null, "gold": [], "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 2876, "tokens_out": 692, "seconds": 7.355, "seed": 4040, "exposed": true}
