{"story_id": "conf_s046", "qid": "conf_s046_q3", "qtype": "Q3", "arm": "D", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "no_unsupported-or-contradicted-facts: [\n  {\n    \"fact_id\": \"EVENT E3\",\n    \"reason\": \"The text states E3 starts at hour 17, but the 'STRUCTURED FACT GRAPH' section lists it as starting at hour 9.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"fact_id\": \"E2\",\n    \"E2_start_time_info_missing_in_graph_section\",\n    \"reason\": \"The E2 event details (start/duration) details are missing from the 'STRUCTURED FACT GRAPH' section.\"\n  },\n_note-on-dependencies-logic_error_in_graph_section_missing_data_unsupported_enough_to_contradict_logic_heavy_on_E5_and_E6_dependency_rules_in_dependencies_section_of_text_text_not_in_graph_section_o_thought_process_for_question_above_but_not_text_task_instruction_instruction_is_to_list_unsupported/contradicted facts in the graph section vs text\",\n  {\n", "raw": "<|channel>thoughtthought least-end-of-thought\n<channel|>To determine which events (excluding E1) would no longer occur if E1 did not happen, we evaluate the dependency rules provided in the text:\n\n1.  **E2**: Is an autonomous root event (always occurs). It does not depend on E1.\n2.  **E3**: Requires parent(s) (E1, E2) under rule **OR**. Since E2 is a root and still occurs, E3 would still occur.\n3.  **E4**: Requires parent(s) (E1) under rule **AND**. If E1 does not happen, E4 cannot occur.\n4.  **E5**: Is an autonomous root event (always occurs). It depends on E2 (which is a root), so it still occurs.\n5.  **E6**: Requires parent(s) (E2) under rule **AND**. Since E2 occurs, E6 still occurs.\n6.  **E7**: Requires parents (E4, E5) under rule **AND**. Since E4 is now blocked by the absence of E1, E7 cannot occur.\n7.  **E8**: Requires parents (E1, E4) under rule **AND**. Since both E1 and E4 are not occurring, E8 cannot occur.\n\nThe events that would no longer occur (excluding E1 itself) are E4, E7, and E8.\n\nSorted list: [\"E4\", \"E7\", \"E8\"]\n\n{\"answer\": [\"E4\", \"E7\", \"E8\"]}", "parsed": ["E4", "E7", "E8"], "gold": ["E4", "E7", "E8"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2856, "tokens_out": 593, "seconds": 6.2546, "seed": 4046, "exposed": true}
{"story_id": "conf_s046", "qid": "conf_s046_q3", "qtype": "Q3", "arm": "F", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>**Relevant Facts:**\n\n*   **Event Dependencies (Rules):**\n    *   E1: Root event (always occurs).\n    *   E2: Root event (always occurs).\n    *   E3: Requires E1 OR E2.\n    *   E4: Requires E1 AND others (specifically E1) to occur.\n    *   E5: Requires E2 (Note: The text says E5 requires E2, but the structured facts list it as a root; I will follow the logic of the prompt's dependency rules).\n    *   E6: Requires E2.\n    *   E7: Requires E4 AND E5.\n    *   E8: Requires E1 AND E4.\n\n*   **Hypothetical Condition:** Event E1 does **not** occur.\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  Identify all events that have E1 as a required parent under an \"AND\" rule.\n2.  Trace the chain of causality: If E1 is removed, check if E4 (which requires E1) is cancelled.\n3.  If E4 is cancelled, check if subsequent events dependent", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To determine which events would no longer occur if E1 did not happen, we evaluate the dependency rules provided:\n\n1.  **E1**: Not occurring (given).\n2.  **E2**: Root event; it occurs regardless of E1.\n3.  **E3**: Requires (E1 OR E2). Since E2 still occurs, E3 still occurs.\n4.  **E_4**: Requires (E1) under rule AND. Since E1 does not occur, **E4 does not occur**.\n5.  **E5**: Requires (E2) under rule AND. Since E2 occurs, E5 still occurs.\n6.  **E6**: Requires (E2) under rule AND. Since E2 occurs, E6 still occurs.\n7.  **E7**: Requires (E4 AND E5). Since E4 is cancelled, **E7 does not occur**.\n8.  **E8**: Requires (E1 AND E4). Since both E1 and E4 are not occurring, **E8 does not occur**.\n\nThe events that would no longer occur are E4, E7, and E8.\n\n{\"answer\": [\"E4\", \"E7\", \"E8\"]}", "parsed": ["E4", "E7", "E8"], "gold": ["E4", "E7", "E8"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2842, "tokens_out": 519, "seconds": 5.4118, "seed": 4046, "exposed": true}
