{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q1", "qtype": "Q1", "arm": "F", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": "---\n### Relevant Facts\n\n\n** Timelining/Events:**\n* **E1**: Start hour 5, Duration 5h (Ends at h-10)\n* **E2**: Start hour 11, Duration 6h (Ends at h-17)\n* **E3**: Start h-19, Duration 3h (Ends at h-22)\n* **E4**: Start hour 26, Duration 6h (Ends at h-32)\n* **E5**: Start hour 34, Duration 5h (Ends at h-39)\n* ****E6**: Start hour 43, Duration 6h (s Ends at h-49)\n* **E7**: Start hour 51, Duration 6h (Ends at h-50/57)\n* **E8**: Start hour 58, Duration 5h (Ends at h-63)\n\n** Temporal Precedence:**\n* E4 precedes E5; E5 precedes E6; E6 precedes E7; E7 precedes E8.\n* Therefore: E4 -> E", "raw": "<|channel>thoughtthought\n<channel|>To determine which event started earlier, we look at the start times provided in the text and structured facts:\n\n- Event E4 (Primary Thruster Ignition) started at hour 26.\n- Event E8 (Inertial Damper Calibration) started at hour 58.\n\nComparing the two, E4 started at hour 26, which is earlier than hour 58.\n\n{\"answer\": \"E4\"}", "parsed": "E4", "gold": "E4", "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 3210, "tokens_out": 346, "seconds": 3.8791, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
