{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q1", "qtype": "Q1", "arm": "C", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thoughtthought fast\n<channel|>To determine which event started earlier, we look at the start times provided in the text/structured facts for E4 and E8:\n\n- Event E4 (Primary Thruster Ignition) started at hour 26.\n- Event E8 (Inertial Damper Calibration) started at hour 58.\n\nComparing the two, E4 (hour 26) started earlier than E8 (hour 58).\n\n{\"answer\": \"E4\"}", "parsed": "E4", "gold": "E4", "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1344, "tokens_out": 105, "seconds": 1.5075, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
