{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q1", "qtype": "Q1", "arm": "F", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Relevant Facts:\n- Event E4 (Primary Thruster Ignition) starts at hour 26.\n- Event E8 (Inertial Damper Calibration) starts at hour 58.\n\nPlan:\n1. Identify the start times for both E4 and E8 from the provided text/structured facts.\n2. Compare the numerical values of the start hours.\n3. Determine which event has the lower start hour value to identify which started earlier.\n4. Formulate the final answer as requested (the Event ID).", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>The start time for Event E4 is hour 26, and the start time for Event E8 is hour 58. Therefore, E4 started earlier.\n\n{\"answer\": \"E4\"}", "parsed": "E4", "gold": "E4", "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2729, "tokens_out": 163, "seconds": 2.0709, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "A", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "user much more detailed de-escalation de de de de de de de de de de de de de much de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de-escalation de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de                               '\nuser much more detailed de-escalation de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de de all de de de de de de de de de de de de de-escalation de de de des\n\n'\n'\n'\n'\n'\n'\n'\n'E4 duration: 6 hours [EV_E4].\nE8 duration: 5 hours [EV_E8].\nTotal combined duration: 6 + 5 = 11.\n\nCheck dependencies for E4 and E8 to ensure they occur:\n- E1 occurs (root) [DEP_E1].\n- E2 occurs (root)\ub85c- No, wait. Let\n- E1 is root [DEP_E1].\n- E1 occurs [DEP_E1/E2].\n_E4 requires E1 [DEP_E4]. Since E1 occurs, E4 occurs.\n_E5 requires E1, E4.\n_E6 requires E1, E3.\n_E7 requires E1 OR E2.\n_E8 requires E4 AND E6.\n\nLet's check if E6 occurs:\n- E1 is root [DEP_E1].\n- E2 is root [DEP_E2].\nE3 requires E2. Since E2 is root, E3 occurs.\nE4 requires E1. Since E1 is root, E4 occurs.\nE5 requires E1, E4. (Both occur).\nE6 requires E1, E3. (E1 is root, E3 depends on E2 which is root. So E1 and E3 occur).\nE7 requires E1 OR E2. (Both occur).\nE8 requires E4 AND E6. \nDoes E4 occur? Yes (depends on E1).\nDoes E6 occur? Yes (depends on E1, E3; E3 depends on E2).\nSince E4 and E6 occur, E8 occurs.\n\nDurations:\nE", "parsed": null, "gold": 11, "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 836, "tokens_out": 512, "seconds": 4.9692, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
