{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thought\ub098- 101.3 kPa [DIST_D2]\n\n# Dependency Rules:\nDEPENDENCY: E1 is a ROOT event (always occurs) [DEP_E1]\nDEPENDENCY: E2 is a ROOT event (always occurs) [DEP_E2]\nDEPENDENCY: E3 requires (E2) with rule AND [DEP_E3]\nDEPENDENCY: E4 requires (E1) with rule AND [DEP_E4]\nDEPENDENCY:E5 requires (E1, E4) with rule AND [DEP_E5]\nDEPENDENCY: E6 requires (E1, E3) with rule AND [DEP_E6]\nDEPENDENCY: E7 requires (E1, E2) with rule OR [DEP_E7]\nDEPENDENCY: E8 requires (E4, E6) with rule AND [DEP_E8]\n\n# Conditional Operational Rules:\nRULE CR1: IF E1 occurs THEN secondary_power_bus = grid_shunted [RULE_CR_1]\n\n# System Metadata:\nMETADATA D1: Orbital Beacon Transponder - firmware checksum is valid 0x7F2A [DIST_D1]\nMETADATA D2: Sector 7 Habitation Ring - atmospheric pressure is 101.3 kPa [DIST_D2]\n\nQUESTION: What is the total combined duration in hours of E4 and E8? Answer with a single integer.\nFormat required: integer. Final line must be JSON: {\"answer\": <value>}.\n<|turn>thought\n<channel|>E4 has a duration of 6 hours.\nE8 has a duration of 5 hours.\nTotal combined duration = 6 + 5 = 11.\n\n{\"answer\": 11}", "parsed": 11, "gold": 11, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1512, "tokens_out": 387, "seconds": 4.1891, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
