{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To find the total combined duration of Event E4 and Event E8, we look at their durations provided in the text/structured facts:\n\n1.  **Event E4 (Primary Thruster Ignition):** Duration is 6 hours [EV_E4].\n2.  **Event E8 (Inertial Damper Calibration):** Duration is 5 hours [EV_E8].\n\nTotal duration = 6 + 5 = 11.\n\nNote: Even though the dependency rules determine if events occur, the question asks for the combined duration of these specific events as defined in the timeline. E4 occurs because its parent E1 (root) occurs. E6 occurs because its parents E1 and E3 occur (E1 is root, E2 is root, E3 requires E2). E8 occurs if E4 and E6 occur. Since E1, E2, E3, E4, and E6 all occur based on the rules, E8 also occurs.\n\n{\"answer\": 11}", "parsed": 11, "gold": 11, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1338, "tokens_out": 220, "seconds": 2.5911, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
{"story_id": "conf_s051", "qid": "conf_s051_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "D", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT E7\",\n    \"reason\": \"The text states E7 starts at hour 51; the structured graph incorrectly lists it as starting at hour 67.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\":_DEPENDENCY: E6 requires (E1, E3) with rule OR\",\n    \"reason\": \"The text specifies E6 requires parent events under rule AND; the graph uses rule OR.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E1\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E2\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"EVENT FAKE_E3\",\n    \"reason\": \"This event is not mentioned in the source text.\"\n  }\n]\n```", "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>E4 has a duration of 6 hours. E8 has a duration of 5 hours. Total = 6 + 5 = 11.\n\n{\"answer\": 11}", "parsed": 11, "gold": 11, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2837, "tokens_out": 264, "seconds": 3.3899, "seed": 4051, "exposed": false}
