till occurs (via E1). Therefore, E8 (E3 OR E6) still occurs because E3 is active.\n\nWait, let's re-evaluate:\n- E2 is gone.\n- E4 requires E2 (AND). E4 is out.\n- E6 requires E2 (AND). E6 is out.\n- E7 requires E2 OR E6. Since both E2 and E6 are not occurring, E7 is out.\n- E3 requires E1 OR E2. E1 occurs, so E3 stays.\n- E5 requires E3 (AND", "parsed": null, "gold": ["E4", "E6", "E7"], "correct": false, "parse_ok": false, "tokens_in": 2912, "tokens_out": 716, "seconds": 7.5972, "seed": 4060, "exposed": true}
