{"story_id": "conf_s073", "qid": "conf_s073_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.3, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To calculate the total combined duration of E3 and E8, we look at the provided text/structured facts for their durations:\n\n1.  **Event E3 (Inertial Damper Calibration):** The text states E3 started at hour 21 with a duration of 4 hours [EV_E3].\n2.  **Event E8 (Subspace Beacon Ping):** The text states E8 started at hour 50 with a duration of 3 hours [EV_E8].\n\nTotal combined duration = Duration(E3) + Duration(E8) = 4 + 3 = 7.\n\nNote: Even though the structured facts list different dependency rules for E3, the durations themselves are explicitly provided in the text and match the event definitions.\n\n{\"answer\": 7}", "parsed": 7, "gold": 7, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1252, "tokens_out": 175, "seconds": 1.89, "seed": 4073, "exposed": true}
