{"story_id": "conf_s076", "qid": "conf_s076_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "B", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "thought\n<channel|>E2 has a duration of 5 hours (start_hour=10, duration_hours=5).\nE8 has a duration of 4 hours (start_hour=52, duration_hours=4).\nTo confirm E8 occurs:\n- E1 and E2 are ROOT events (always occur).\n- E3 requires E2 (occurs).\n- E4 requires E2 (occurs).\n- E5 requires E2 OR E4 (occurs).\n- E6 requires E4 AND E5 (E4 occurs, E5 occurs -> E6 occurs).\n- E7 requires E1 OR E2 (occurs).\n- E8 requires E1 AND E2 (both occur, so E8 occurs).\n\nTotal duration = 5 + 4 = 9.\n\n{\"answer\": 9}", "parsed": 9, "gold": 9, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 818, "tokens_out": 184, "seconds": 1.9447, "seed": 4076, "exposed": false}
{"story_id": "conf_s076", "qid": "conf_s076_q2", "qtype": "Q2", "arm": "C", "level": 0.0, "pass1_raw": null, "raw": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>To find the total combined duration of E2 and E8, we look at the provided timestamps:\n\n1.  **Event E2 (Thermal Radiator Deployment):** Duration is 5 hours [EV_E2].\n2.  **Event E8 (Inertial Damper Calibration):** Duration is 4 hours [EV_E8].\n\nThe total combined duration is 5 + 4 = 9 hours.\n\n{\"answer\": 9}", "parsed": 9, "gold": 9, "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 1513, "tokens_out": 102, "seconds": 1.3385, "seed": 4076, "exposed": false}
