curs. Thus E8 occurs via the \"OR\" rule because its parent E5 occurs.\n\nTherefore, no other events are prevented from occurring by the absence of E2.\n\n{\"answer\": []}", "parsed": [], "gold": [], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 3300, "tokens_out": 697, "seconds": 7.6227, "seed": 4086, "exposed": false}
