rom occurring by the non-occurrence of E6 under an AND rule.\n\n```json\n{\"answer\": [\"E7\"]}\n```", "parsed": ["E7"], "gold": ["E7"], "correct": true, "parse_ok": true, "tokens_in": 2981, "tokens_out": 583, "seconds": 6.3682, "seed": 4087, "exposed": true}
